cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ORION in your research, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "ORION: Ordinary Repository for Input-Output Necessities"
abstract: >-
  ORION is a modular I/O toolkit for reading and writing structured,
  multi-block scientific data across multiple file formats. It provides both
  Fortran and Python interfaces, plus a standalone command-line converter,
  designed for integration into high-performance and scientific computing
  workflows. Supported formats include Tecplot (ASCII and binary via TecIO),
  VTK and PLOT3D.
type: software

authors:
